'''Gimmighoul''' (Japanese: '''コレクレー''' ''Collecurei'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

