==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{form|Gimmighoul|Chest Form}} {{p|Gimmighoul}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Gimmighoul|87}} (087/182) from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion.
*This card's illustration rare artwork was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Gimmighoul|198}} (198/182) from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion, as was its '''Continuous Coin Toss''' attack.
**This artwork forms a combined illustration with {{TCG ID|Paldean Wonders|Gholdengo ex|114}}, which was also [[Gholdengo ex (Paradox Rift 252)|first featured]] in Paradox Rift.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Gimmighoul}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

